for a saved credential. Relocate with $KIRO_HOME.
.TP
\fB~/.kiro/workspace\-roots/<key>/permissions.yaml\fR
The Kiro CLI's workspace permissions files, one per workspace key. Vet reads
permission rules and policies, reports only a blanket shell allow as
overbroad, and checks every rule pattern for a saved credential. A
permissions.yaml that is a symlink is not followed and is reported as a
coverage gap. Relocate workspace\-roots/ with $KIRO_HOME.
.TP
\fB~/.aws/amazonq/settings/mcp.json\fR
A legacy Amazon Q Developer CLI MCP configuration location that machines
migrated to Kiro CLI 2.x can carry. Vet reads MCP server launchers, endpoints,
environment entries, and headers, and findings name the legacy file itself.
.TP
\fB~/.aws/amazonq/agents/\fR
Legacy Amazon Q Developer CLI agent configs from the fallback that the Kiro
