overridden row that names any other row's file, a content row that is a
credential store at its default location, or the later of two Cline files
linked to each other. The other row is read as usual unless it is also an
override naming the same file, in which case both rows are skipped. A
credential store is never opened through any Cline row.
.TP
\fB~/.cline/data/secrets.json\fR
Cline credential store. Vet uses stat\-only permission metadata: mode only,
with no byte read. Cline creates this file at 0600. Group or other read
permission produces a HIGH finding; Windows has no POSIX mode and produces no
mode finding. Relocate the data directory with CLINE_DATA_DIR, otherwise
CLINE_DIR/data (default ~/.cline/data). Vet inspects each path component
before opening it, follows local links, and refuses links to network shares;
it reports SymlinkLoop after eight links, NotARegularFile for a non\-regular
